    {
      "id": 1507101,
      "anchor": "Point06",
      "name": { "en": "Bone, Hardened ad Nauseam", "zh-CN": "百炼骨" },
      "description": {
        "en": "Mortenax Blade can accumulate up to #2[i] overflow Energy. After using Ultimate, clears it and regenerates a corresponding amount of Energy. When the battle starts or when the Zone is dispelled, if Energy is below #1[i]%, it is immediately regenerated to #1[i]%. When Energy is regenerated to its maximum, dispels all debuffs from this unit.",
        "zh-CN": "千冶•刃可积攒最多#2[i]点溢出能量，施放终结技后清空并恢复相应的能量值。战斗开始时或结界解除时，若能量不足#1[i]%则立刻恢复至#1[i]%。当能量恢复至上限时解除自身所有负面效果。"
      },
