      "anchor": "Point07",
      "name": { "en": "Soul, Tempered ad Mortem", "zh-CN": "千锻魂" },
      "description": {
        "en": "While the Zone is active, increases the chance of being attacked by enemies, decreases DMG taken by this unit by #2[i]%, and increases Incoming Healing by #3[i]%. After being attacked, inflicts the \"Balefire Bind\" state on the corresponding target, and enables Mortenax Blade to gain 1 Charge.",
        "zh-CN": "结界持续期间，被敌方攻击的概率提高，自身受到的伤害降低#2[i]%，受到的治疗量提高#3[i]%，且受到攻击后使对应目标陷入【煞火缠身】状态并使千冶•刃获得1点充能。"
